Cases: defaultPurpose:  Define what needs to be built. Each case is a complete specification  for a feature, bugfix, or change.Lifecycle:  DRAFT > READY > ACTIVE > DONE | ARCHIVEDStructure:  <case-id>.sdd:    id: <CASE-ID>    type: feature|bugfix|change|task    title: <title>    purpose: <why>    status: DRAFT|READY|ACTIVE|DONE|ARCHIVED    state: ~    created: <timestamp>    updated: <timestamp>    depends_on:      - <case-id>    produces:      - <output>    chain: @chain    template: @template    stages:      - AN: ~      - AR: ~      - DB: ~      - BE: ~      - API: ~      - FE: ~      - MD: ~      - QA: ~      - DO: ~      - VR: ~Rules:  [C1] Every case MUST have a unique ID.  [C2] Every case MUST declare its chain.  [C3] Every case MUST declare its template.  [C4] Case state MUST be updated after each stage.   [C5] Cases MUST be resolved before execution starts.State: +
